      "en": "For the LORD says, “You were sold for nothing; and you will be redeemed without money.”",
      "ko": "여호와께서 이같이 말씀하시되 너희가 값 없이 팔렸으니 돈 없이 속량되리라",
      "source_text_hash": "0873f76b8e41aaf9b6691fbe9afd6871265a3beb3bb119fef9f02f7b7bb1e67c",
      "translation_text_hash": "7a84e3f44d12a967fd21e2d6b944f191d3b291fcd6e1be9a94485d1f48a6de5f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
