      "en": "The LORD has made his holy arm bare in the eyes of all the nations. All the ends of the earth have seen the salvation of our God.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 열방의 목전에서 그 거룩한 팔을 나타내셨으므로 모든 땅 끝까지도 우리 하나님의 구원을 보았도다",
      "source_text_hash": "0bdce1158fc207c4ca5c2796328d60050666e499807bfbc2e940887688bd5186",
      "translation_text_hash": "b1a4c80d0df4f0a1779b875598eed249841d96e4afa04c1aa17eeb0b0fa3635a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
